dy":"The Wireless team will be performing planned maintenance on network elements serving our European site. Devices roaming in Europe may experience a brief data interruption while sessions re-establish, not expected to last more than 5 minutes per device. No action is required from customers.","created_at":"2026-11-04T10:41:33Z","display_at":"2026-11-04T10:41:33Z","incident_id":"01M6K2CNVM0CV4NEG18Y2WSKAT","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:41:33Z"}]},{"id":"01M66X0H0RJ9NE1APR5VCF415G","name":"Voice Services Update - All Regions","status":"in_progress","created_at":"2026-10-30T17:16:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:30:00Z","monitoring_at":"2026-11-02T03:30:00Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M6D4X2KKHJ0GKB9FJTZ0EC0C","body":"Maintenance has started","created_at":"2026-11-02T03:30:00Z","display_at":"2026-11-02T03:30:00Z","incident_id":"01M66X0H0RJ9NE1APR5VCF415G","status":"maintenance_in_progress","updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:30:00Z"},{"id":"01M66X0H0RG5Z2K7VH7PK8Q3Z5","body":"Our Telephony Engineers will be performing an update on our Voice Services servers across all regions\n\nImpact: This update is not expected to disrupt service.\n\nAction Required: If you experience any audio issues or dropped calls during this maintenance window, please report them immediately to Telnyx Support","created_at":"2026-10-30T17:16:38Z","display_at":"2026-10-30T17:16:38Z","incident_id":"01M66X0H0RJ9NE1APR5VCF415G","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-30T17:16:38Z"}]},{"id":"01M63TYBM6DW48WY57E51XN6T8","name":"Telnyx Cloud Storage us-west-1 region maintenance","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-10-29T12:42:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:42:47Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M63TYBM6ZY6FA8Q0GENTFHR9","body":"Apologies, we are starting the previously-planned maintenance early due to security concerns.\n\nCustomers may experience intermittent cloud storage service for buckets located in us-west-1 region during the maintenance window.","created_at":"2026-10-29T12:42:47Z","display_at":"2026-10-29T12:42:47Z","incident_id":"01M63TYBM6DW48WY57E51XN6T8","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:42:47Z"}]},{"id":"01M57148XXNHWY4YG6SCK8BSAY","name":"Scheduled maintenance for Programmable Wireless - US","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-10-18T08:12:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:12:54Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M57148XX9664GNGW455JEZPV","body":"The Wireless team will move voice (IMS) session handling at our US core site to upgraded infrastructure to improve VoLTE call reliability. During the window, new voice registrations may briefly fail and retry while traffic is moved; existing sessions and data services are not expected to be affected, and any disruption is not expected to last more than 5 minutes. Affected users are in North, Central and South America and the Caribbean.","created_at":"2026-10-18T08:12:54Z","display_at":"2026-10-18T08:12:54Z","incident_id":"01M57148XXNHWY4YG6SCK8BSAY","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:12:54Z"}]},{"id":"01M5706YB16F3VCABKG01KMT11","name":"Scheduled maintenance for Programmable Wireless - US","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:56:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:56:52Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M5706YB186NYDKFDNHBRK4QC","body":"The Wireless team will apply core network configuration updates at our US sites to improve data and voice (IMS) session setup. During the window, new data or voice connections may briefly fail to establish while each site is updated; existing sessions are not expected to be affected, and any disruption is not expected to last more than 5 minutes per site. Affected users are in North, Central and South America and the Caribbean.","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:56:52Z","display_at":"2026-10-18T07:56:52Z","incident_id":"01M5706YB16F3VCABKG01KMT11","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:56:52Z"}]},{"id":"01M4ZXAVQJMC8JADTT9HAXCYN0","name":"Scheduled maintenance for Programmable Wireless - US (GTP Proxy Update)","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:54Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M4ZXAVQJN6AXGCJ1BY7AMWJC","body":"The Wireless team will perform maintenance on our GTP proxy infrastructure in the US region. During this time there is a potential for brief service disruption for connectivity sessions in the affected region (North, Central and South America as well as the Caribbean). This maintenance is not expected to last more than 5 minutes.","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:54Z","display_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:54Z","incident_id":"01M4ZXAVQJMC8JADTT9HAXCYN0","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:54Z"}]},{"id":"01M4DKZW9NE94DW1N32NP149PC","name":"Wireless Maintenance – US East and US Central (DC2, CH1)","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-10-08T11:22:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T18:05:33Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M4DKZW9ND8F594JRE6WK09AR","body":"The Wireless team will be performing scheduled maintenance on the US packet core sites, applying configuration updates to session management and charging, one site at a time. Some devices may see a brief interruption to data sessions while sessions re-establish; any disruption is not expected to last more than 5 minutes. This affects users in North, Central and South America as well as the Caribbean.","created_at":"2026-10-08T11:22:17Z","display_at":"2026-10-08T11:22:17Z","incident_id":"01M4DKZW9NE94DW1N32NP149PC","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-10-08T11:22:17Z"}]},{"id":"01M2R7F45MHRYX9WWREFMNMWM1","name":"Wireless Maintenance - UDSF Version Rollback (All Sites)","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-09-17T17:43:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T17:43:40Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M2R7F45MK2CPD70G7W5T3PMJ","body":"The Wireless team will be performing a UDSF (Unified Data Storage Function) software version rollback across all three sites (Chicago, Ashburn, and Sydney). This is a precautionary alignment to a Mavenir-supported version. The UDSF pods will restart during the maintenance window. No customer impact is expected. The maintenance is not expected to last more than 2 hours.","created_at":"2026-09-17T17:43:41Z","display_at":"2026-09-17T17:43:40Z","incident_id":"01M2R7F45MHRYX9WWREFMNMWM1","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-09-17T17:43:41Z"}]},{"id":"01M2NFK0WCX6RD69DC4KQRZ0JW","name":"[DC2] Wireguard Server Migration","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-09-16T16:07:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T16:07:53Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01M2NFK0WC6Q3KFBJJW26FTYSG","body":"We will be doing a maintenance on wireguard server in the Ashburn (DC2) region. No IP addresses will be changed, so impact should be limited to client re-handshake with the server. \nNo customer action required.","created_at":"2026-09-16T16:07:54Z","display_at":"2026-09-16T16:07:53Z","incident_id":"01M2NFK0WCX6RD69DC4KQRZ0JW","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-09-16T16:07:54Z"}]},{"id":"01KSMA0PJCQMBW1E6QXFYP3AF9","name":"Scheduled maintenance for Programmable Voice - Voice API","status":"scheduled","created_at":"2026-05-27T08:49:59Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T08:49:59Z","impact":"maintenance","page_id":"01KPRP4VXQG1BSRN7S80HCZDDK","incident_updates":[{"id":"01KSMA0PJCVSAKZEA7PSMNN8HP","body":"`Our Telephony Engineers will perform maintenance on our Programmable Voice services in the Europe/US region. This maintenance should not disrupt service.`","created_at":"2026-05-27T08:49:59Z","display_at":"2026-05-27T08:49:59Z","incident_id":"01KSMA0PJCQMBW1E6QXFYP3AF9","status":"maintenance_scheduled","updated_at":"2026-05-27T08:49:59Z"}]}]}
